OL,3,GNEWSA'People know what MND is now
OL,4,Athanks to Sinfield'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Hull KR fan living with motor neurone
OL,7,Fdisease (MND) will help launch Kevin
OL,8,FSinfield's final challenge to raise
OL,9,Fawareness of the condition.
OL,11,FThe former rugby league player will run
OL,12,Fseven ultra marathons over seven days,
OL,13,Fstarting at Hull KR's Craven Park on
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,FCraig Eskrett, an avid KR supporter and
OL,17,Ffundraiser who was diagnosed with MND
OL,18,Fin 2023, will be at the start line when
OL,19,FSinfield sets off on his 7 in 7: The
OL,20,FGrand Finale.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
